cff-version: 1.2.0
title: BLOSUM Alignment Painter
message: If you use this tool in a publication, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: David W. J.
    family-names: McQuarrie
repository-code: 'https://github.com/dxm958/blosum62-painter'
url: 'https://dxm958.github.io/blosum62-painter/'
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool that aligns amino acid sequences with
  Needleman-Wunsch and BLOSUM-62, then shades each alignment column
  red for identity or orange for a substitution scoring at or above a
  chosen BLOSUM-62 threshold. Exports publication-ready SVG and PNG.
keywords:
  - sequence alignment
  - BLOSUM62
  - protein
  - bioinformatics
  - figure generation
license: MIT
version: 3.0.0
